<title>JAPAN: Parco -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Parco -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		137.01		vs	  131.87</p>
<p> Operating	    2.79		vs	    2.54</p>
<p> Current		2.21		vs	    1.84</p>
<p> Net		    1.07		vs	  674    million</p>
<p> EPS		   19.80 yen	  vs	   14.33 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     56 million	  vs	  48 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Parco Co Ltd operates shopping centres specialising in fashion speciality shops.</p>
</text>
